      Contrast Matrix Reference
    </h3>
    <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--dark-gray); margin-bottom: 20px;">
      Rows = Background Color | Columns = Text Color<br />
      Values indicate WCAG Contrast Ratio. <br />
      <strong>Bold (✓)</strong> = AA Compliant (>= 4.5)
    </p>
    <div style="overflow-x: auto;">
      <table
        id="contrast-matrix"
        style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-family: monospace; font-size: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;"
